<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60230" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρῠ-όεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chilling</i>, in metaph. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβου κρυόεντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυόεσσα Ἰωκή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.740
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πολέμῳ κρυόεντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					936
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντυχία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					1.37
				</span></i>
			: later in lit. sense, <i>icy-cold</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλς, πάγος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.918
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.221
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τάρταρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					222
				</span></i>
			; of Saturn, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				1.172
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκρυόεις</span>.</div>
